window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>New York, 1939. Running into his old friend Dorothy Parker on the street, Dorian finds himself accompanying her to the opening of an antiquities exhibition. But when one of the guests is murdered, Dorian and Dorothy have no choice but to find the killer before their culprit has a chance to strike again.... </p><p>Note: <i>The Confessions of Dorian Gray</i> contains adult material and is not suitable for younger listeners. </p>"; 
